<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Blades and Fades | Newburgh, IN</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #111;
      color: #fff;
    }

    header {
      background: #000;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #c59d5f;
    }

    header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 2.5em;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    nav {
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #c59d5f;
      margin: 0 15px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .hero {
      background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1585747860715-2ba37e788b70') no-repeat center/cover;
      height: 400px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero h2 {
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
      padding: 20px;
      font-size: 2em;
    }

    section {
      padding: 40px 20px;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .services {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .service {
      flex: 1 1 250px;
      background: #1c1c1c;
      padding: 20px;
      border-left: 4px solid #c59d5f;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      background: #000;
      border-top: 2px solid #c59d5f;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 15px;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      background: #c59d5f;
      color: #000;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>Blades and Fades</h1>
  <nav>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#services">Services</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="hero">
  <h2>Sharp Cuts. Clean Fades. Premium Style.</h2>
</div>

<section id="about">
  <h2>About Us</h2>
  <p>
    Welcome to Blades and Fades, your go-to barbershop in Newburgh, Indiana.
    We specialize in precision cuts, modern fades, and classic grooming.
    Whether you're looking for a fresh look or a clean-up, we've got you covered.
  </p>
</section>

<section id="services">
  <h2>Our Services</h2>
  <div class="services">
    <div class="service">
      <h3>Haircuts</h3>
      <p>Modern and classic styles tailored to you.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service">
      <h3>Fade Cuts</h3>
      <p>Skin fades, tapers, and custom blends.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service">
      <h3>Beard Grooming</h3>
      <p>Sharp lines, trims, and full beard shaping.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service">
      <h3>Hot Towel Shaves</h3>
      <p>Relaxing and smooth traditional shave experience.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
  <h2>Contact Us</h2>
  <p><strong>Location:</strong> Newburgh, IN</p>
  <p><strong>Phone:</strong> (Your Phone Number)</p>
  <p><strong>Hours:</strong> Mon–Sat: 9am – 7pm</p>
  <a href="#" class="btn">Book Appointment</a>
</section>

<footer>
  <p>&copy; 2026 Blades and Fades. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>